her). Feeds Sun AND Weather so they never drift.\n• STREET VIEW: pulls the real reference plate — aim it with heading / pitch / fov.\n• SUN POSITION: computes the REAL sun direction + elevation → a light description.\n• WEATHER: real conditions for that day/hour."}, "color": "#223", "bgcolor": "#5a3a63"}, {"id": 17, "type": "Note", "pos": [880, -150], "size": [820, 150], "flags": {}, "order": 2, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "title": "③ Set & cast references", "properties": {"text": ""}, "widgets_values": ["Who is in the shot + what it looks like.\n• LOAD the 3 references: background/set, actor 1, actor 2 (upload your own, or pick from the ref_env_* / ref_char_* library already in your input folder).\n• SET & CAST: name the actors in actor_1_name / actor_2_name — THIS is the single source of truth for the cast (change a reference → rename here to match). It resizes + bundles the plate + references for the image model and writes the reference notes the story uses."], "widgets_values_named": {"text": "Who is in the shot + what it looks like.\n• LOAD the 3 references: background/set, actor 1, actor 2 (upload your own, or pick from the ref_env_* / ref_char_* library already in your input folder).\n• SET & CAST: name the actors in actor_1_name / actor_2_name — THIS is the single source of truth for the cast (change a reference → rename here to match). It resizes + bundles the plate + references for the image model and writes the reference notes the story uses."}, "color": "#223", "bgcolor": "#63501f"}, {"id": 18, "type": "Note", "pos": [1760, -150], "size": [840, 150], "flags": {}, "order": 3, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "title": "④ Story → dress the plate → save", "properties": {"text": ""}, "widgets_values": ["The classic recce.\n• PROMPT BUILDER: gathers the grounded facts (location, real light, real weather, cast & set references, optional 'direction') into one prompt.\n• NANO BANANA PRO: dresses the real plate using that prompt + your references (needs Comfy login/credits).\n• SAVE IMAGE: the final shot.\nTo change the scene: move the globe, set the Shoot Time, swap references + names, then Queue."], "widgets_values_named": {"text": "The classic recce.\n• PROMPT BUILDER: gathers the grounded facts (location, real light, real weather, cast & set references, optional 'direction') into one prompt.\n• NANO BANANA PRO: dresses the real plate using that prompt + your references (needs Comfy login/credits).\n• SAVE IMAGE: the final shot.\nTo change the scene: move the globe, set the Shoot Time, swap references + names, then Queue."}, "color": "#223", "bgcolor": "#2e5424"}, {"id": 3, "type": "VRStreetViewReference", "pos": [461.9322372179239, 291.2606693039171], "size": [360, 340], "flags": {}, "order": 10, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "latitude", "name": "latitude", "type": "FLOAT", "widget": {"name": "latitude"}, "link": 3}, {"localized_name": "longitude", "name": "longitude", "type": "FLOAT", "widget": {"name": "longitude"}, "link": 4}, {"localized_name": "heading", "name": "heading", "type": "FLOAT", "widget": {"name": "heading"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "pitch", "name": "pitch", "type": "FLOAT", "widget": {"name": "pitch"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "fov", "name": "fov", "type": "FLOAT", "widget": {"name": "fov"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "width", "name": "width", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "width"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "height", "name": "height", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "height"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "google_api_key", "name": "google_api_key", "type": "STRING", "widget": {"name": "google_api_key"}, "link": 2}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "reference_image", "name": "reference_image", "type": "IMAGE", "links": [9, 26]}, {"localized_name": "status", "name": "status", "type": "STRING", "links": null}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "VRStreetViewReference"}, "widgets_values": [34.1184, -118.3004, 150, 5, 90, 640, 640, "